        "padding": "32px"
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# 🌎 Plate Tectonics\n\n### *The Engine That Reshapes Earth*\n\nEarth's **lithosphere** is divided into massive tectonic plates that slowly drift across the softer **asthenosphere**.\n\n🔥 **Mantle convection** powers their movement.\n\n🌋 Their interactions create:\n\n- ⛰️ Mountain ranges\n- 🌊 Ocean basins\n- 🌋 Volcanoes\n- 💥 Earthquakes\n- 🌎 Continents that never stop moving\n\n> *Our planet is not a static world. It is a living, ever-changing mosaic of moving plates.*",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784950188325,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
