      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## 🔥 What Moves the Plates?\n\nHeat from Earth's interior drives slow circulation in the mantle. Ridge push, slab pull, and mantle flow help move plates a few centimeters per year.",
